{
  "_note": "服务详情:summary.json(服务分项 / 进行中事故与全部更新 / 计划维护);incident.io 那几家另取 incidents.json。近期事故与近 30 天统计走 hist.df(与首页共用一份缓存)。解析在页面 JS 里做;首屏缓存同样在 JS 层(存精简模型,DigitalOcean 的 summary 就有 84KB),故豁免 data 层缓存。",
  "_lintCache": "exempt",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "idIn",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${id},)]"
      },
      "_note": "入参落地(勿删)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${idIn},github),1,0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "sm",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://www.githubstatus.com/api/v2/summary.json",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "8000"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${idIn},claude),1,0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "sm",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://status.claude.com/api/v2/summary.json",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "8000"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${idIn},openai),1,0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "sm",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://status.openai.com/api/v2/summary.json",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "8000"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "hj",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://status.openai.com/api/v2/incidents.json",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "8000"
          },
          "_note": "incident.io 兼容层:summary.json 里没有事故,进行中事故与它们的更新从 incidents.json(最新 25 条)取。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
